#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:22
msgid "phpBB Repository"
msgstr "phpBB-repository"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:25
msgid "Forking and Cloning"
msgstr "Fork og kloning"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:26
msgid ""
"To contribute to phpBB development, you should sign up for a `GitHub "
"<https://github.com>`_ user account if you don't already have one."
msgstr ""
"For at bidrage til udviklingen af phpBB bør du oprette en brugerkonto på "
"`GitHub <https://github.com>`_, hvis du ikke allerede har en."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:29
msgid ""
"Begin by forking the `phpBB repository <https://github.com/phpbb/phpbb>`_ to"
" your account, by clicking the \"Fork\" button at phpBB's repository."
msgstr ""
"Begynd med at forke `phpBB-repositoryet <https://github.com/phpbb/phpbb>`_ "
"til din konto ved at klikke på knappen \"Fork\" på phpBB's repository."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:32
msgid ""
"Clone your fork of phpBB's repository to your computer: ``git clone "
"git://github.com/<my_github_name>/phpbb.git``"
msgstr ""
"Klon din fork af phpBB's repository til din computer: ``git clone "
"git://github.com/<my_github_name>/phpbb.git``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:35
msgid ""
"See `Set Up Git <https://help.github.com/articles/set-up-git>`_ for help on "
"setting up Git."
msgstr ""
"Se `Set Up Git <https://help.github.com/articles/set-up-git>`_ for hjælp til"
" at opsætte Git."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:38
msgid "Branches"
msgstr "Brancher"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:39
msgid ""
"`master <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/master>`_ - The latest unstable "
"development version with new features etc."
msgstr ""
"`master <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/master>`_ - Den nyeste ustabile "
"udviklingsversion med nye funktioner osv."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:40
msgid ""
"`3.3.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/3.3.x>`_ - Development branch of "
"the 3.3 line. Bug fixes and minor feature changes are applied here."
msgstr ""
"`3.3.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/3.3.x>`_ - Udviklingsbranch for "
"3.3-linjen. Fejlrettelser og mindre funktionsændringer anvendes her."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:41
msgid ""
"`3.2.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/3.2.x>`_ - Development branch of "
"the 3.2 line. Bug fixes and minor feature changes are applied here."
msgstr ""
"`3.2.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/3.2.x>`_ - Udviklingsbranch for "
"3.2-linjen. Fejlrettelser og mindre funktionsændringer anvendes her."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:42
msgid ""
"`3.1.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/3.1.x>`_ - Development branch of "
"the stable 3.1 line. phpBB 3.1 has reached its End of Life and is therefore "
"no longer maintained."
msgstr ""
"`3.1.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/3.1.x>`_ - Udviklingsbranch for "
"den stabile 3.1-linje. phpBB 3.1 har nået sin End of Life og vedligeholdes "
"derfor ikke længere."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:43
msgid ""
"`3.0.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/3.0.x>`_ - Development branch of "
"the stable 3.0 line. phpBB 3.0 has reached its End of Life and is therefore "
"no longer maintained."
msgstr ""
"`3.0.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/3.0.x>`_ - Udviklingsbranch for "
"den stabile 3.0-linje. phpBB 3.0 har nået sin End of Life og vedligeholdes "
"derfor ikke længere."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:44
msgid ""
"`2.0.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/2.0.x>`_ - Development branch of "
"the deprecated 2.0 line."
msgstr ""
"`2.0.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/2.0.x>`_ - Udviklingsbranch for "
"den forældede 2.0-linje."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:47
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Tags"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:48
msgid ""
"Tags are released versions. Stable ones get merged into the master branch."
msgstr ""
"Tags er udgivne versioner. Stabile udgivelser sammenlægges med master-"
"branchen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:50
msgid "release-3.Y.Z-aX - Alpha release X of the 3.Y.Z line."
msgstr "release-3.Y.Z-aX - Alpha-udgivelse X af 3.Y.Z-linjen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:51
msgid "release-3.Y.Z-bX - Beta release X of the 3.Y.Z line."
msgstr "release-3.Y.Z-bX - Beta-udgivelse X af 3.Y.Z-linjen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:52
msgid "release-3.Y.Z-RCX - Release candidate X of the stable 3.Y.Z release."
msgstr ""
"release-3.Y.Z-RCX - Release candidate X af den stabile 3.Y.Z-udgivelse."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:53
msgid "release-3.Y.Z - Stable 3.Y.Z release."
msgstr "release-3.Y.Z - Stabil 3.Y.Z-udgivelse."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:54
msgid "release-2.0.X - Deprecated stable 2.0.X release."
msgstr "release-2.0.X - Forældet stabil 2.0.X-udgivelse."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:56
msgid ""
"This means all bug-fix development should take place on the 3.2.x branch, "
"and will be merged into higher branches, including master. All feature "
"development should take place in master. Read more about the workflow in the"
" next section."
msgstr ""
"Dette betyder, at al fejlrettelsesudvikling bør foregå på 3.2.x-branchen og "
"vil blive sammenlagt med højere brancher, herunder master. Al "
"funktionsudvikling bør foregå i master. Læs mere om arbejdsgangen i næste "
"afsnit."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:61
msgid "How to contribute?"
msgstr "Hvordan bidrager man?"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:62
msgid ""
"When fixing a bug, please post in the `bug tracker "
"<https://tracker.phpbb.com>`__. When adding a feature to 3.x post your patch"
" for review in a new topic on the `[3.x] Discussion forum "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/phpBB/viewforum.php?f=81>`__ at Area51. Please "
"either provide a link to your commit or branch on GitHub or attach a patch "
"created with ``git format-patch``. For larger features or changes consider "
"adding it as an idea to `phpBB Ideas "
"<https://www.phpbb.com/community/ideas>`_ or posting an RFC on Area51 first."
msgstr ""
"Når du retter en fejl, bedes du poste i `bug trackeren "
"<https://tracker.phpbb.com>`__. Når du tilføjer en funktion til 3.x, skal du"
" poste dit patch til gennemgang i et nyt emne på `[3.x] Discussion forum "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/phpBB/viewforum.php?f=81>`__ på Area51. Angiv "
"venligst enten et link til dit commit eller din branch på GitHub, eller "
"vedhæft et patch oprettet med ``git format-patch``. For større funktioner "
"eller ændringer bør du overveje at tilføje det som en idé til `phpBB Ideas "
"<https://www.phpbb.com/community/ideas>`_ eller først poste en RFC på "
"Area51."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:70
msgid "Branch Names"
msgstr "Branchnavne"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:71
msgid ""
"Branch names must have a prefix ending with a slash. There are only 3 types "
"of prefixes allowed:"
msgstr ""
"Branchnavne skal have et præfiks, der ender med en skråstreg. Der er kun 3 "
"typer præfikser tilladt:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:73
msgid "``feature/`` followed by a feature name for branches adding a feature."
msgstr ""
"``feature/`` efterfulgt af et funktionsnavn for brancher, der tilføjer en "
"funktion."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:74
msgid ""
"``task/`` followed by a task name for branches which neither adding a "
"feature nor fixing bugs."
msgstr ""
"``task/`` efterfulgt af et opgavenavn for brancher, der hverken tilføjer en "
"funktion eller retter fejl."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:75
msgid "``ticket/`` followed by a ticket number for branches fixing bugs."
msgstr ""
"``ticket/`` efterfulgt af et sagsnummer for brancher, der retter fejl."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:77
msgid "Branch naming examples:"
msgstr "Eksempler på branchnavngivning:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:79
msgid "``feature/feature-name`` for features."
msgstr "``feature/feature-name`` for funktioner."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:80
msgid "``task/task-name`` for tasks."
msgstr "``task/task-name`` for opgaver."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:81
msgid "``ticket/12345`` for bugs fixes."
msgstr "``ticket/12345`` for fejlrettelser."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:83
msgid ""
"When branches go into the main phpBB repository they are renamed to "
"**<category>/<user>/<name-or-id>**"
msgstr ""
"Når brancher går ind i hoved-repositoryet for phpBB, omdøbes de til "
"**<category>/<user>/<name-or-id>**"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:84
msgid ""
"or **user/<category>/<name-or-id>** to make clear from which developer's "
"repository the branch was merged."
msgstr ""
"eller **user/<category>/<name-or-id>** for tydeligt at angive, fra hvilken "
"udviklers repository branchen blev sammenlagt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:87
msgid "Commit Messages"
msgstr "Commit-beskeder"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:88
msgid ""
"You should always `create a ticket <https://tracker.phpbb.com>`_ before "
"starting work. It is important that every commit references a ticket. It "
"does not matter what state that ticket is in. No line should contain more "
"than 79 characters. The first line should be followed by a blank line. This "
"means you should not break the first sentence of your message! The purpose "
"of this is to maintain useful --oneline logs which only display the first "
"line of every message. A good commit message then looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"Du bør altid `oprette en sag <https://tracker.phpbb.com>`_, før du begynder "
"at arbejde. Det er vigtigt, at hvert commit refererer til en sag. Det er "
"ligegyldigt, hvilken tilstand sagen er i. Ingen linje bør indeholde mere end"
" 79 tegn. Den første linje bør efterfølges af en tom linje. Dette betyder, "
"at du ikke bør bryde den første sætning i din besked! Formålet med dette er "
"at opretholde nyttige --oneline-logs, som kun viser den første linje af hver"
" besked. En god commit-besked ser derefter sådan ud:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:108
msgid "An example:"
msgstr "Et eksempel:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:124
msgid ""
"The structure of a commit message which is verified by the commit-msg hook "
"is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Strukturen af en commit-besked, som verificeres af commit-msg-hooken, er som"
" følger:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:135
msgid ""
"The required components are the summary, branch, and list of tickets; the "
"description is optional. Both the description and ticket list must be "
"preceded by a **single** empty line. The description element is unrestricted"
" length and may contain any number of empty lines to separate paragraphs; "
"each ticket in the list must be on its own line. If the branch is a "
"[ticket/] branch, the ticket list must contain a matching ticket, finally "
"the ticket list may not contain any duplicates."
msgstr ""
"De obligatoriske komponenter er resuméet, branchen og listen over sager; "
"beskrivelsen er valgfri. Både beskrivelsen og sagslisten skal være forudgået"
" af **én enkelt** tom linje. Beskrivelseselementet har ubegrænset længde og "
"kan indeholde et vilkårligt antal tomme linjer til at adskille afsnit; hver "
"sag på listen skal stå på sin egen linje. Hvis branchen er en "
"[ticket/]-branch, skal sagslisten indeholde en matchende sag, og endelig må "
"sagslisten ikke indeholde nogen dubletter."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:143
msgid "Developers"
msgstr "Udviklere"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:144
msgid "Review `Forking and Cloning`_."
msgstr "Se `Fork og kloning`_."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:147
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:150
msgid "Add your Username to Git on your system:"
msgstr "Tilføj dit brugernavn til Git på dit system:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:156
msgid "Add your E-mail address to Git on your system:"
msgstr "Tilføj din e-mailadresse til Git på dit system:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:162
msgid ""
"Add the upstream remote (you can change 'upstream' to whatever you like):"
msgstr "Tilføj upstream-remoten (du kan ændre 'upstream' til hvad du vil):"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:169
msgid ""
"The *upstream* remote url **is** the phpBB GitHub repo. Your cloned fork of "
"the phpBB GitHub repo will, by default, use the *origin* remote url."
msgstr ""
"Remote-URL'en *upstream* **er** phpBB's GitHub-repo. Din klonede fork af "
"phpBB's GitHub-repo vil som standard bruge remote-URL'en *origin*."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:173
msgid "Composer"
msgstr "Composer"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:174
msgid ""
"To be able to run an installation from the repo (and not from a pre-built "
"package) you need to run the following shell commands to install phpBB's "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""
"For at kunne køre en installation fra repoet (og ikke fra en færdigbygget "
"pakke) skal du køre følgende shell-kommandoer for at installere phpBB's "
"afhængigheder."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:182
msgid "Ignore any *abandoned package* warnings."
msgstr "Ignorér eventuelle *abandoned package*-advarsler."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:186
msgid ""
"`Introduction - Composer <https://getcomposer.org/doc/00-intro.md>`_ for "
"further information."
msgstr ""
"`Introduction - Composer <https://getcomposer.org/doc/00-intro.md>`_ for "
"yderligere information."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:190
msgid "Hooks"
msgstr "Hooks"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:191
msgid ""
"The phpBB repository contains some client-side hooks that can aid "
"development. They are located in the ``git-tools/hooks`` directory. These "
"hooks do things like preparing and validating commit messages, checking for "
"PHP syntax errors. There is a script to set them up (which symlinks them "
"into ``.git/hooks``)."
msgstr ""
"phpBB's repository indeholder nogle klientsidehooks, der kan hjælpe "
"udviklingen. De findes i mappen ``git-tools/hooks``. Disse hooks gør ting "
"som at forberede og validere commit-beskeder og kontrollere for PHP-"
"syntaksfejl. Der findes et script til at opsætte dem (som symlinker dem ind "
"i ``.git/hooks``)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:201
msgid ""
"In case you get an error, stating the hooks already exist. Simply remove all"
" files from ``.git/hooks`` and re-run the install command."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du får en fejl, der angiver, at hooksene allerede findes, skal du blot "
"fjerne alle filer fra ``.git/hooks`` og køre installationskommandoen igen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:204
msgid ""
"Once these hooks are installed, you simply need to run ``git commit`` to "
"commit new changes. Depending on your environment, you will be prompted to "
"add a commit message using `Vim <http://vimdoc.sourceforge.net/htmldoc/>`__ "
"or `Emacs "
"<https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Help.html>`__. "
"The hooks will take care of formatting your entire commit message in the "
"required format (see `Commit Messages`_)."
msgstr ""
"Når disse hooks er installeret, skal du blot køre ``git commit`` for at "
"committe nye ændringer. Afhængigt af dit miljø vil du blive bedt om at "
"tilføje en commit-besked ved hjælp af `Vim "
"<http://vimdoc.sourceforge.net/htmldoc/>`__ eller `Emacs "
"<https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Help.html>`__. "
"Hooksene vil sørge for at formatere hele din commit-besked i det krævede "
"format (se `Commit-beskeder`_)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:212
msgid "Creating local branches"
msgstr "Oprettelse af lokale brancher"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:213
msgid ""
"To work on phpBB you need to create local branches of whichever develop "
"branch (e.g. *master*) you need. Issue the following command to perform this"
" operation:"
msgstr ""
"For at arbejde på phpBB skal du oprette lokale brancher af den "
"udviklingsbranch (f.eks. *master*), du har brug for. Kør følgende kommando "
"for at udføre denne handling:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:221
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "Arbejdsgang"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:224
msgid "Pulling in upstream changes"
msgstr "Hente upstream-ændringer"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:225
msgid ""
"You will need to merge in changes made to the upstream repository for them "
"to appear in your fork, the steps to do this follow. We're assuming you are "
"performing this on the **master** branch, but it could be a bug fix branch "
"or a develop release branch, so ensure you are on the correct branch using "
"``git branch`` and change with ``git checkout`` if required."
msgstr ""
"Du skal sammenlægge ændringer foretaget i upstream-repositoryet, for at de "
"kan komme til syne i din fork; trinene til at gøre dette følger. Vi antager,"
" at du gør dette på **master**-branchen, men det kunne være en "
"fejlrettelsesbranch eller en udviklingsudgivelsesbranch, så sørg for, at du "
"er på den korrekte branch ved hjælp af ``git branch``, og skift med ``git "
"checkout``, hvis nødvendigt."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:230
msgid "1. Pull the changes from the upstream **master** branch: ::"
msgstr "1. Hent ændringerne fra upstream **master**-branchen: ::"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:235
msgid ""
"2. Push the changes back to your fork (substitute master for the current "
"branch): ::"
msgstr ""
"2. Push ændringerne tilbage til din fork (erstat master med den aktuelle "
"branch): ::"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:240
msgid ""
"The following image visualises the phpBB branching model. It may help you to"
" understand the different branches this section refers to later."
msgstr ""
"Følgende billede visualiserer phpBB's branching-model. Det kan hjælpe dig "
"med at forstå de forskellige brancher, dette afsnit henviser til senere."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:246
msgid "Bug fixing"
msgstr "Fejlretning"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:247
msgid ""
"Ensure you are using the correct develop branch (e.g. *3.2.x*) first and not"
" the *master* branch. In this example we are using 3.2.x."
msgstr ""
"Sørg først for, at du bruger den korrekte udviklingsbranch (f.eks. *3.2.x*) "
"og ikke *master*-branchen. I dette eksempel bruger vi 3.2.x."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:262
msgid "Starting a new feature"
msgstr "Starte en ny funktion"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:263
msgid ""
"Ensure you are using the correct develop branch (e.g. *master*) first.  In "
"this example we are using master."
msgstr ""
"Sørg først for, at du bruger den korrekte udviklingsbranch (f.eks. "
"*master*). I dette eksempel bruger vi master."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:277
msgid "Collaborating with other developers on a feature"
msgstr "Samarbejde med andre udviklere om en funktion"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:278
msgid ""
"You have pushed a new feature to GitHub and another developer has worked on "
"it. This is how you can integrate their changes into your own feature "
"branch."
msgstr ""
"Du har pushet en ny funktion til GitHub, og en anden udvikler har arbejdet "
"på den. Sådan kan du integrere deres ændringer i din egen funktionsbranch."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:291
msgid "Merging a feature or bugfix branch"
msgstr "Sammenlægning af en funktions- eller fejlrettelsesbranch"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:292
msgid ""
"Once a feature or bug-fix is complete it can be merged back into the master "
"branch. To preserve history we never fast-forward such merges. In this "
"example we will merge the bug-fix created earlier into 3.2.x. We then merge "
"the changes into 3.3.x and then merge 3.3.x into master to keep these "
"branches up to date."
msgstr ""
"Når en funktion eller fejlrettelse er færdig, kan den sammenlægges tilbage "
"med master-branchen. For at bevare historikken laver vi aldrig fast-forward "
"ved sådanne sammenlægninger. I dette eksempel sammenlægger vi den "
"fejlrettelse, vi oprettede tidligere, med 3.2.x. Derefter sammenlægger vi "
"ændringerne med 3.3.x og sammenlægger så 3.3.x med master for at holde disse"
" brancher opdaterede."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:307
msgid ""
"Additionally the merge.log config setting of Git is set to true, producing a"
" summary of merged commits."
msgstr ""
"Derudover er config-indstillingen merge.log i Git sat til true, hvilket "
